{{!-- The attrs include stays inside the meta tag region so single-source
     stubs keep inheriting :description: as a header attribute, and the
     value now refreshes with the connector instead of being frozen at
     first draft. Component families with no description partial keep the
     inline attribute.
     No fallback line when neither exists: an emitted TODO would become
     the attribute VALUE and stubs would inherit it into their meta tags.
     Missing descriptions are the tracked editorial backlog
     (cloud-docs .github/description-allowlist.txt). --}}

